# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hydra — environment variables
#
# Nothing here is required. Hydra runs with zero configuration; these only
# unlock optional behaviour. Set them in Vercel → Project → Settings → Env Vars.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Encrypts the entire configuration blob (including the TorBox API key) with
# AES-256-GCM before it is placed in the addon URL.
#
# Without it, the URL contains a deflate-compressed but readable config — the
# same behaviour as Torrentio and most other addons. With it, a leaked or
# screenshotted URL reveals nothing.
#
# Use at least 16 random characters. Changing this value invalidates every
# previously generated addon URL, so pick once and keep it.
#
# CONFIG_SECRET=change-me-to-something-random-and-long

# Local dev only — port for `npm run dev`.
# PORT=7000
